@node Pascal Frontend
@chapter Pascal Frontend Language

Pascal is a procedural language designed for structured programming and teaching.
The EIGHTBOL Pascal frontend enables Pascal programs to be compiled for 8-bit and
16-bit platforms. This chapter documents Pascal syntax, semantics, statements,
expressions, types, and AST mappings with comprehensive examples.

